<title>MEXICO: Emvasa 6-mo net narrows.</title>
<headline>Emvasa 6-mo net narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mo 1997		   6-mo 1996</p>
<p>	Revs		 560.94 million	     565.48 million</p>
<p>	Net		   29.11 million		56.26 million</p>
<p>	Oper Income	 34.79 million		20.41 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain    11.12 million   gain     35.95 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Embotelladores de Valle de Anahuac, S.A.</p>
<p>((-- Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
